preparing operational dashboards and data summaries for various internal and external stakeholders;

collaborating closely with IT or platform vendors to address technical issues, as well as with project managers, analysts, and researchers, convert data requirements into practical solutions while ensuring adherence to data protection and security standards.

Enquiries about the duties of the post should be sent to Ms Cynthia Yau at cynthyau@hku.hk.

