To be responsive and be able to tackle with the challenges of maintaining a healthy and stable markets, today's practitioners in the financial service industry must possess quantitative and business know-how to manage the financial instruments and inter-bank dynamics. The MSc Programme in Financial Engineering coordinated by the Centre for Financial Engineering is set to fulfil such a societal demand of talents.

